<%- include('dash-header') %><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">LET THE THOUGHT KEEP GOING</p><h1>Work, in the background.</h1><p class="heading-description">You don’t have to stay on the line. Pick up the result when you’re ready.</p></div><a class="dash-button lime" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs/new') %>">+ Start a task</a></div><nav class="filter-tabs" aria-label="Task status"><% [['all','All work'],['queued','Queued'],['running','In progress'],['done','Done'],['partial','Partial'],['failed','Stopped']].forEach(([value,label])=>{ %><a href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs',{state:value}) %>" <%- state===value?'aria-current="page"':'' %>><%= label %></a><% }) %></nav><% if(!jobs.length) { %><section class="dash-panel dash-empty large"><span class="empty-glyph violet-text">↗</span><h2><%= state==='all'?'A little room for a bigger thought.':'No tasks with this status.' %></h2><p>Research a question. Draft something thoughtful. Compare the options. Start here or ask one of your assistants.</p><a class="dash-button lime" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs/new') %>">Give Brain a task ↗</a></section><% } else { %><div class="task-grid"><% jobs.forEach(job=>{ %><a class="task-card dash-panel" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs/'+job.id) %>"><div class="memory-card-top"><span class="state-pill state-<%= job.state %>"><i></i><%= job.state %></span><span>↗</span></div><h2><%= job.title||job.task.slice(0,90) %></h2><p><%= job.result_summary||job.task.slice(0,220) %></p><div class="memory-card-meta"><strong><%= job.requested_by_agent %></strong><time><%= relativeTime(job.finished_at||job.created_at) %></time></div></a><% }) %></div><% } %><%- include('dash-footer') %>
